ai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/934260/158d4dfb3614db6f03261799606d681c20a37a8a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745775969","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":1543920,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Groundfall is a minimalist sandbox game where you fly bush airplanes in an open wilderness setting!  Attempt to take-off and land your STOL airplane at rugged and remote locations as you complete missions to explore, camp, build, survive, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly aerial missions while working to keep yourself and your airplane in one piece.  When you're not flying, you'll be busy surviving! <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/934260/extras/0573d628585926331b8ec9db1d0426a1.poster.avif?t=1745775969\" width=798 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/934260/extras/0573d628585926331b8ec9db1d0426a1.webm?t=1745775969\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/934260/extras/0573d628585926331b8ec9db1d0426a1.mp4?t=1745775969\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/934260/extras/cbbb41f15d45498fc641b2d22dc179a6.avif?t=1745775969\" width=600 height=75 /></span><strong>Flight Features:</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-based Flight</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Airplane Damage/repair System </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Airplane Fueling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flaps </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Water Assisted Landings (hydro-plane) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Terrain-based Friction (wet grass, mud, snow, ice) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival &amp; Crafting Features:</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple weapons, tools, and resources can be crafted, found, or unlocked</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft primitive tools and weapons </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build Campsites, Shelters, Cabins, and even\u00a0 Runways </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather, harvest, and hunt food and other resources to manage energy, hunger, and thirst\u00a0 (optional)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental Features:</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open world maps and missions </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lush ground vegetation and trees </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simulated seasonal weather with rain, snow, lightning </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Volumetric fog/clouds </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AI wildlife</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GroundFall is in constant development, future updates will included new maps, improvements, mission objectives, and more  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Snow Creature"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/934260/header.jpg?t=1745775969","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/934260/540476/8da6354f50f0e22b3513faa4b43c8e1c7a45403f/1751165897/dash_av1.mpd?t=16767